@Luftborn.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5162

### Create a product
POST {{Luftborn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 1500
}

### Get all products
GET {{Luftborn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET {{Luftborn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/2

### Update product
PUT {{Luftborn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "price": 2000
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{Luftborn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/2